{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42277","headline":"和江西萧少卿见寄二首 二 · 徐铉","name":"和江西萧少卿见寄二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"身遥上国三千里，名在朝中二十春。\n金印不须辞入幕，麻衣曾此叹迷津。\n卷舒由我真齐物，忧喜忘心即养神。\n世路风波自飜覆，虚舟无计得沉沦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42277.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42277","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}